    "text": "IT is hereby notified under regulation 30 of the Wages Boards Regulations, that Mr. Sarath Wijesinghe has been appointedas Employer's Representative of the Wages Board for the Rubber (Including Tyre Manufacturing and Re-building), Plasticand Petroleum Resin Products Manufacturing Trade in place of Mr. D. K. Sanjeewa Serasinghe by the Hon. Minister ofLabour Under Section 9 of the Wages Board Ordinance (Chapter 136). These appointment is valid only up to 15.02.2016.",
